// Import a customer's full history from Splynx's Transaction Report -- a
// different, richer file from the one-row-per-invoice ledger
// LedgerImportModal above reads. See billing.transaction_import's module
// docstring for why this exists: that coarser export can leave a real
// settlement (a salary deduction, on the account that surfaced this) with
// no importable Payment row at all, understating nothing the coarse file
// itself shows wrong -- it just never shows the gap. This file proves
// itself instead: every row carries the account's own running balance, so
// the whole chain either adds up or the import refuses outright rather
// than writing a partial, silently-wrong history.
